#: mason/index.mas
msgid "What is Breedbase?"
msgstr ""

#: mason/index.mas
msgid ""
"Breedbase is a comprehensive breeding management and analysis software. It "
"can be used to design field layouts, collect phenotypic information using "
"tablets, support the collection of genotyping samples in a field, store "
"large amounts of high density genotypic information, and provide Genomic "
"Selection related analyses and predictions. Breedbase supports the BrAPI "
"standard."
msgstr ""

